<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Anime World - Video Compilation</title>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Anime World</h1>
    <p>
      Welcome to Anime World! Explore exciting anime moments,
      epic battles, and amazing adventures through these videos.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>Epic Anime Battles</h2>
      <p>Watch some exciting anime battle scenes filled with action.</p>
      <iframe
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/2X8f7fY8g7Q"
        title="Epic Anime Battles"
        height="315"
        width="560"
        allowfullscreen>
      </iframe>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Anime Adventures</h2>
      <p>Discover incredible adventures and unforgettable anime moments.</p>
      <iframe
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ScMzIvxBSi4"
        title="Anime Adventures"
        height="315"
        width="560"
        allowfullscreen>
      </iframe>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Anime Motivation</h2>
      <p>Enjoy inspiring moments from the world of anime.</p>
      <iframe
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/tgbNymZ7vqY"
        title="Anime Motivation"
        height="315"
        width="560"
        allowfullscreen>
      </iframe>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
